INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Production Scenario: Scaling JavaScript Algorithm Problems with Debounce

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Statement
A high-concurrency production service for a Frontend Developer application encounters performance bottlenecks and latency spikes during peak load. The engineering team decides to leverage Debounce as part of the JavaScript Algorithm Problems optimization strategy.

#### Solution Architecture
