INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Pitfalls & Best Practices: Server Architecture & Microservices — Message Queues (Kafka/RabbitMQ)

**Role Target**: Backend Developer | **Level**: Hard

#### Top 3 Common Mistakes
1. **Ignoring Edge Cases**: Failing to account for null, empty, or out-of-order data when dealing with Message Queues (Kafka/RabbitMQ).
2. **Over-Engineering**: Applying complex variations of Message Queues (Kafka/RabbitMQ) when a simple, direct solution suffices.
3. **Missing Telemetry**: Omitting error logging and structured metrics around Message Queues (Kafka/RabbitMQ) in production.

#### Hardening Checklist for Production
- [x] Unit test coverage >= 85% covering error scenarios.
- [x] Graceful degradation strategy verified during simulated outages.
