A high-concurrency production service for a Backend Developer application encounters performance bottlenecks and latency spikes during peak load. The engineering team decides to leverage HTTP/1.1 vs HTTP/2 vs HTTP/3 as part of the HTTP/HTTPS & Networking optimization strategy.

