- **Data Flow**: Incoming requests pass through an optimized pipeline where Dijkstra shortest path manages concurrency and isolates failures.
- **Failover & Resilience**: Incorporates exponential backoff and circuit breaker patterns to guarantee 99.99% availability.

#### Key Metrics & Results
