- **Resource Utilization**: CPU and memory footprints stabilized across all worker nodes.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "DSA & Problem Solving", "subtopic": "Dijkstra shortest path", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "languages": ["Java"], "source": "InterviewMind-AI-Curated-Dataset-v1"}'::jsonb)
